WEBVTT

00:15.250 --> 00:17.790
I guess it makes sense that once you come up
against Rounds' direct subordinates,

00:17.790 --> 00:19.000
it gets to be a little tough.

00:19.960 --> 00:23.540
Still, I'm not seeing the
Knight Beyond Men anywhere.

00:26.420 --> 00:27.920
And the item we're looking for...

00:30.170 --> 00:31.920
...has already been carried off.

00:32.580 --> 00:34.420
Guess that means the end of Oriana.

00:34.710 --> 00:36.040
You let your guard down!

00:36.040 --> 00:37.250
You fool!

00:42.880 --> 00:44.580
Nevertheless...

00:45.540 --> 00:48.920
everything shall be as our lord wills it.

00:55.830 --> 00:57.920
That is too late

00:57.920 --> 01:00.830
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:00.830 --> 01:03.000
That is to say...

01:05.960 --> 01:12.170
The first move chooses an unknown future
Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future<b></b>

01:12.170 --> 01:14.500
How it will be
Sono arisama<b></b>

01:14.830 --> 01:15.960
This way

01:15.960 --> 01:22.210
The last move decides the world's answer
Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer<b></b>

01:22.210 --> 01:24.830
A single winner
Hitori no winner<b></b>

01:24.830 --> 01:26.210
It's me

01:26.460 --> 01:28.750
These eyes have seen it
Kono me wa misueta<b></b>

01:30.250 --> 01:35.830
The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o<b></b>

01:37.130 --> 01:40.920
It's all a game to control the board
Subete wa banjou shihai suru game<b></b>

01:40.920 --> 01:43.420
A battle of thought
Shikou no tousou<b></b>

01:43.580 --> 01:46.000
I disguise even my mistakes
Mistake sae mo gisou shite<b></b>

01:46.000 --> 01:48.580
And even checkmate is a preparatory move
Checkmate made fuseki toshite<b></b>

01:48.580 --> 01:51.000
A game to take each other's king
King o ubaiau game<b></b>

01:51.000 --> 01:53.460
Ideology and desire
Shisou to yokubou<b></b>

01:53.750 --> 01:56.130
A bad move to not let one chance get away
One chance minogasanu akushu<b></b>

01:56.130 --> 01:58.790
The last chance will cinch it
Last chance kanarazu shitomeru<b></b>

01:59.040 --> 02:01.040
That is too late

02:01.040 --> 02:03.960
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

02:03.960 --> 02:06.130
That is to say

02:06.130 --> 02:11.080
Total victory is in my hands
Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni<b></b>

02:16.380 --> 02:19.170
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

02:20.130 --> 02:24.920
<b>#11 Determination</b>

02:26.540 --> 02:28.630
<i>So to sum up what I learned yesterday,</i>

02:28.630 --> 02:33.920
<i>apparently Rose's hands are tied because
Pervert has taken her mother hostage.</i>

02:34.670 --> 02:38.290
<i>Frankly, I wonder why she would let that
bother her after she's come so far.</i>

02:38.670 --> 02:42.670
<i>But I figure, I can just chalk it up to
Rose's personal aesthetic.</i>

02:43.460 --> 02:45.000
<i>The solution is simple.</i>

02:45.460 --> 02:49.630
<i>I just have to use my Eminence in Shadow moves
to free the hostage myself.</i>

02:50.040 --> 02:52.880
<i>Thus I will remove her shackles,</i>

02:52.880 --> 02:56.880
<i>and we're sure to get one step closer
to the birth of the legendary tyrant.</i>

02:57.210 --> 03:00.000
I was so worried about you yesterday, Mr. Apprentice.

03:00.380 --> 03:04.500
After you got lost on my watch,
I was so distraught I couldn't sleep a wink.

03:04.830 --> 03:05.830
I see.

03:05.830 --> 03:09.170
And lately, there's been this
creepy guard wandering around.

03:09.170 --> 03:11.830
You can hardly call the castle grounds safe anymore.

03:12.130 --> 03:13.130
I see.

03:13.130 --> 03:15.130
But don't you worry!

03:15.130 --> 03:16.420
That stalk-

03:16.420 --> 03:18.080
...frightening man is gone now.

03:18.080 --> 03:18.920
I see.

03:18.920 --> 03:20.920
He's been formally accused of stealing food.

03:20.920 --> 03:23.710
No one saw him do it, but we all know it was him.

03:23.710 --> 03:25.710
I see...

03:26.000 --> 03:28.920
I did everything I could for you, Mr. Apprentice.

03:29.170 --> 03:31.830
Rest assured, I will protect you and keep you safe.

03:31.830 --> 03:33.460
From that scary stalker,

03:33.460 --> 03:35.250
and from that woman who claims to be your teacher

03:35.250 --> 03:37.580
but really wants to crush your talent.

03:37.580 --> 03:38.790
Who exactly...

03:39.580 --> 03:42.210
...wants to crush whose talent now?

03:45.500 --> 03:47.460
My, my, if it isn't Ms. Shiron!

03:47.460 --> 03:49.580
I thought you were in the middle of a recital?

03:49.580 --> 03:50.880
It's intermission.

03:51.290 --> 03:55.040
And I was worried that someone might be distracting
my darling student from his responsibilities.

03:55.040 --> 03:58.000
I assure you those worries are totally unfounded.

03:58.000 --> 04:01.670
Because I am here to support Mr. Apprentice
in everything that he needs.

04:01.670 --> 04:04.420
Do you really need people to
spell things out for you?

04:04.420 --> 04:07.080
Perhaps your head is full of
flowers blooming or something?

04:07.080 --> 04:08.920
<i>Nature versus nurture...
</i>My, how frightening!<b></b>

04:08.920 --> 04:10.670
<i>They never get along.</i>

04:10.670 --> 04:12.460
<i>I guess that's true no matter where you go.</i>

04:21.540 --> 04:24.170
They may be on the verge of war.

04:24.460 --> 04:25.960
How can they be so nonchalant?

04:27.080 --> 04:30.170
Yeah, it does seem like the palace dwellers
are pretty unconcerned about everything.

04:30.710 --> 04:33.500
The nobility detests violence and adores the arts.

04:33.500 --> 04:35.960
That's how it's been throughout Oriana's history,

04:36.210 --> 04:37.750
because of the Black Rose.

04:39.080 --> 04:40.500
Black Rose...

04:41.540 --> 04:42.750
We are...

04:42.750 --> 04:44.460
...the Black Rose Brotherhood!

04:44.750 --> 04:46.540
The Black Rose Brotherhood!

04:46.830 --> 04:48.500
The Black Rose Brotherhood!

04:49.130 --> 04:51.130
Yeah, that was kinda different.

04:51.500 --> 04:53.710
Well, I would like to see the real deal.

04:54.630 --> 04:56.580
You mean, you actually want to see it?

04:57.000 --> 04:58.210
Of course.

04:58.210 --> 04:59.420
It's here, isn't it?

04:59.920 --> 05:02.790
Well, you're right about that, but...

05:03.210 --> 05:05.290
But it's far too dangerous...

05:05.830 --> 05:08.460
Still, if we want to totally destroy it...

05:09.500 --> 05:10.710
No...

05:11.330 --> 05:14.040
If that is your choice, Lord Shadow.

05:18.000 --> 05:19.710
<i>That's my Epsilon!</i>

05:19.710 --> 05:21.960
<i>I'm just a little curious about seeing the flowers,</i>

05:21.960 --> 05:24.130
<i>and she makes it sound like
the most dramatic thing in the world.</i>

05:24.580 --> 05:27.330
<i>Anyway, I am interested in seeing a black rose,</i>

05:27.830 --> 05:30.880
<i>but finding Queen Reina comes first.</i>

05:33.170 --> 05:35.540
They're awfully procreative for the middle of the day.

05:35.540 --> 05:36.580
Stop that.

05:36.580 --> 05:38.460
We see nothing, hear nothing, and think nothing.

05:38.460 --> 05:40.880
But the kingdom won't last long if this keeps up.

05:44.960 --> 05:46.380
Tell me, darling.

05:46.380 --> 05:48.920
Can't we get them to accept our love yet?

05:49.250 --> 05:50.920
Be patient just a little while longer, honey.

05:50.920 --> 05:53.790
Once the wedding is over,
we'll have no more use for Rose.

05:54.000 --> 05:56.710
Be honest.
She's the one you want to marry.

05:56.960 --> 05:59.000
You're the only one I love, sweetcakes.

05:59.710 --> 06:03.580
You'll kill her as soon as your done with her,
and then marry me, won't you?

06:03.880 --> 06:05.380
Of course I will, sugarpops.

06:07.960 --> 06:09.580
<i>This is no good at all.</i>

06:09.880 --> 06:12.710
<i>It's changed from an isekai fantasy
to a daytime soap opera.</i>

06:13.580 --> 06:17.290
I have to find a way to correct course
back to that 6pm time-slot.

06:18.420 --> 06:20.500
Course...

06:20.790 --> 06:23.710
Well, it's a pretty complicated family matter.

06:24.130 --> 06:27.040
And if I know Rose, if she just finds out the truth,

06:27.040 --> 06:30.630
her rage will drive her to a full awakening
as the tyrant I know she can be.

06:31.170 --> 06:32.170
Yeah.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.250
Here.

06:35.710 --> 06:36.920
If you'll excuse me.

06:37.290 --> 06:38.500
Margaret...

06:39.250 --> 06:40.500
What?

06:40.500 --> 06:42.080
Nothing, I just...

06:42.080 --> 06:44.080
If it's nothing, then I'll take my leave.

06:52.420 --> 06:55.670
That girl will never smile at me again.

06:56.210 --> 06:57.420
Even so...

06:57.880 --> 07:00.040
At least, for my father's sake...

07:01.380 --> 07:03.920
If I can at least save my mother...

07:21.380 --> 07:22.580
Sha...

07:24.040 --> 07:25.960
Lord Shadow...

07:28.130 --> 07:30.710
Are you here to kill me?

07:34.040 --> 07:35.250
I...

07:35.920 --> 07:39.210
I returned your kindness with betrayal.

07:40.290 --> 07:41.500
I'm sorry.

07:48.380 --> 07:49.580
Come with me.

07:50.790 --> 07:52.630
I will show you the truth.

07:53.040 --> 07:54.460
The truth...

08:01.130 --> 08:02.380
Oh, Perv...

08:02.380 --> 08:05.540
Soon, the kingdom will be all ours,
won't it, darling?

08:06.250 --> 08:09.170
Yes, honey, and all thanks to you.

08:09.920 --> 08:13.420
It was worth it to keep drugging
that idiot husband of mine.

08:13.880 --> 08:16.330
He made such a lovely puppet.

08:16.750 --> 08:19.630
If she hadn't killed him,
he could have done more for us!

08:19.920 --> 08:22.960
Rose should have been the first one we killed.

08:23.420 --> 08:25.880
We have more work to do because of her.

08:28.670 --> 08:30.790
Oh, Perv! Perv!

08:35.040 --> 08:36.460
This is the truth.

08:36.460 --> 08:39.130
No! My mother would never-

08:41.210 --> 08:42.960
Accept the truth.

08:43.830 --> 08:45.290
The time is ripe.

08:45.790 --> 08:47.460
What did your eyes show you?

08:48.880 --> 08:51.460
What do you hold in your hands?

08:52.540 --> 08:54.500
Rise, Tyrant.

08:55.420 --> 08:57.880
Unleash the blade of rebellion and...

09:05.460 --> 09:08.750
Uh, this is your chance to eliminate the traitors...

09:09.420 --> 09:11.380
I'm here to help...

09:13.710 --> 09:15.790
Well, yeah.

09:16.580 --> 09:18.460
I'm sorry, I guess.

09:33.830 --> 09:35.040
I...

09:35.670 --> 09:37.000
What was the point?

09:37.670 --> 09:38.880
Those men...

09:39.420 --> 09:40.630
My father...

09:52.920 --> 09:54.130
I want to go back.

09:55.170 --> 09:56.670
Let me go back!

09:57.080 --> 09:59.330
Let me go back to those happy days!

10:00.580 --> 10:01.790
My dear Cid!

10:36.210 --> 10:37.420
Cid...

10:38.500 --> 10:39.920
Cid, it's you...

10:41.380 --> 10:43.040
Let's run away together,

10:43.580 --> 10:46.080
to a faraway world that no one has heard of.

10:46.960 --> 10:49.040
I killed my father,

10:49.040 --> 10:50.670
I was betrayed by my mother,

10:50.670 --> 10:52.500
I betrayed my organization,

10:52.500 --> 10:55.080
and I have been forsaken by my people.

10:55.710 --> 10:57.330
But you, Cid...

10:57.630 --> 11:00.040
You're the only one who has stayed
with me through it all,

11:00.040 --> 11:01.500
no matter what.

11:02.250 --> 11:04.540
So I know, as long as I have you...

11:06.080 --> 11:07.830
I like this piece of music.

11:08.710 --> 11:11.420
It makes it so much easier to see the world.

11:12.830 --> 11:14.250
See the world?

11:14.830 --> 11:16.880
I've divided the world into two categories:

11:17.420 --> 11:20.080
the things that matter, and the things that don't.

11:20.500 --> 11:23.080
But why?

11:23.750 --> 11:26.540
Because I had a dream that would
never come true if I didn't.

11:27.000 --> 11:28.250
A dream...

11:30.580 --> 11:33.750
We only have so much time, and so much effort.

11:34.250 --> 11:37.380
So I dedicated all of my time and
effort to what mattered,

11:37.380 --> 11:39.710
and I cut myself loose from everything else.

11:40.130 --> 11:41.330
"What mattered"?

11:42.290 --> 11:44.170
You did all of that for me?

11:45.040 --> 11:47.670
But there is too much static to let us do that.

11:48.080 --> 11:51.920
The static clouds the world,
and hides the things that matter.

11:52.500 --> 11:56.250
It's so easy for people to lose sight
of what's really important.

11:56.880 --> 11:59.750
If you ask me, the world is too bright.

12:00.290 --> 12:04.330
You see too many things,
and that's why you lose track of what matters.

12:04.750 --> 12:05.960
That's...

12:06.380 --> 12:11.790
That's why I think that the illumination from
the moon is just right for our world.

12:12.880 --> 12:17.040
It makes everyone look more closely,
so they don't lose sight of what matters.

12:18.000 --> 12:21.710
We just need to stand in the moonlight,
only seeing the things that matter.

12:21.710 --> 12:22.920
That's all.

12:23.380 --> 12:24.580
And so...

12:25.080 --> 12:29.210
In this world lit by the moon,
what is it that you see?

12:35.960 --> 12:37.460
Cid...

12:47.630 --> 12:48.830
My dear Cid...

12:51.420 --> 12:52.630
I...

12:53.630 --> 12:55.040
I lost the ring.

12:55.540 --> 12:57.290
Did somebody steal it from me?

12:57.420 --> 12:58.920
Grr, how dare they?!

12:59.210 --> 13:02.330
Well, let's just say I spend money
as fast as I make it.

13:02.710 --> 13:05.330
I did what I could to convince Rose.

13:05.540 --> 13:07.580
If she has the heart of a lion,

13:07.580 --> 13:10.710
then she will pull herself up
and raise the banner of rebellion.

13:11.040 --> 13:12.380
I think.

13:12.380 --> 13:13.580
Probably.

13:16.210 --> 13:17.420
Epsilon?

13:17.580 --> 13:20.420
I'll scrub your back for you, Lord Shadow.

13:25.960 --> 13:30.330
<i>Her slime body has evolved to the point
where you could mistake it for the real thing.</i>

13:30.960 --> 13:32.540
I'm a little embarrassed.

13:32.540 --> 13:34.330
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

13:34.330 --> 13:36.420
The consistency and shape are superb.

13:36.420 --> 13:38.500
You have done well to reach this level.

13:40.080 --> 13:42.170
I didn't do anything.
It just happened naturally.

13:42.420 --> 13:45.080
There was a slightly
unexpected development today.

13:45.080 --> 13:47.330
Oh, my! I hope everything is all right.

13:47.330 --> 13:49.670
I think there probably won't be a problem.

13:49.670 --> 13:51.210
I've given her the key.

13:51.540 --> 13:53.920
If she has the strength to pull herself up,

13:53.920 --> 13:56.580
the banner of rebellion will rise of its own accord.

13:56.580 --> 13:57.790
The key?

13:57.790 --> 13:59.080
You gave it to her?

13:59.080 --> 14:00.960
No wonder we couldn't find it.

14:01.630 --> 14:03.460
The decisive battle will be in three days.

14:04.880 --> 14:06.210
At the wedding.

14:07.000 --> 14:09.830
The sleeping lion will wake.

14:11.750 --> 14:15.750
<i>I mean, three days should be enough time
to process her emotions, right?</i>

14:25.330 --> 14:27.000
Cancel the damn wedding!

14:27.000 --> 14:28.630
Drag that phony princess off her throne!

14:28.630 --> 14:30.000
Disband the parliament!

14:30.580 --> 14:33.670
Anyone who says anything against
Princess Rose is part of the resistance!

14:33.670 --> 14:34.880
Fire!

14:40.460 --> 14:41.710
I'm almost there.

14:42.080 --> 14:44.380
Just a little longer,
and all the loose ends will be tied up.

14:44.880 --> 14:47.830
Thinking back on it, I did run into
several unforeseen complications.

14:48.420 --> 14:52.040
I had no trouble using that fool of a woman
to make the king my puppet, but...

14:52.920 --> 14:54.130
That blasted Geerk.

14:54.130 --> 14:57.500
How could I have known he would risk
his own well-being to tamper with the ring?

14:58.170 --> 15:00.210
He transferred ownership of
the Ring of Succession

15:00.210 --> 15:03.000
from himself to Princess Rose.

15:04.130 --> 15:06.540
Sir Mordred told me that,
in order to become owner of the ring myself,

15:06.540 --> 15:11.750
I will need to marry Rose and
integrate my blood into the royal line.

15:12.170 --> 15:15.250
I can't deny that is exactly how I'd
expect an artifact to behave,

15:15.250 --> 15:17.500
but I do loathe that it must work that way.

15:17.920 --> 15:20.540
But regardless of the means,
the ends will be worth it,

15:20.540 --> 15:23.500
for now, I, too, will be one of Rounds!

15:33.040 --> 15:36.130
Now, I, too, will be one of Rounds!

15:40.250 --> 15:41.540
One of Rounds!

15:45.830 --> 15:47.040
Hold on...

15:47.290 --> 15:48.630
Wait! Just wait a minute!

15:48.630 --> 15:50.210
Wait j-just a darn, just wait a minute!

15:50.210 --> 15:51.420
Wait a minute! What?!

15:51.420 --> 15:52.790
Wh-wh-where did it go?!

15:52.790 --> 15:54.630
Where? What?
How in the...

15:54.630 --> 15:55.830
Wh-wh-where?

15:55.830 --> 15:57.040
I can't find it!

15:57.880 --> 15:59.080
It's gone.

15:59.790 --> 16:02.580
I've lost it?

16:05.130 --> 16:06.830
Perv Asshat...

16:08.000 --> 16:10.000
Sir Mordred!

16:10.330 --> 16:11.750
Rejoice, Perv Asshat.

16:11.750 --> 16:13.380
The arrangements have been completed on this end.

16:13.830 --> 16:16.500
Once the ceremony is over,

16:16.500 --> 16:21.330
the 12th Seat in Rounds will be yours.

16:21.540 --> 16:22.790
Y-yes, sir!

16:25.080 --> 16:26.540
I have high hopes for you,

16:26.790 --> 16:29.630
Perv Asshat.

16:31.750 --> 16:34.040
It-it-it's...

16:35.130 --> 16:39.420
It's... it's not like I'll need
the Ring of Succession right away!

16:41.330 --> 16:44.500
I'll come up with some kind of excuse
to delay the exchange of rings.

16:45.420 --> 16:46.960
Yeah! That's what I'll do!

17:13.710 --> 17:15.670
It wasn't time for her to go down the aisle.

17:15.670 --> 17:17.420
Don't worry about it.

17:17.420 --> 17:21.290
This is just a formality to abdicate
everything to Duke Asshat anyway.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.500
Perv Asshat...

17:36.830 --> 17:39.330
Do you take Rose Oriana to be your wife,

17:39.330 --> 17:42.330
to have and to hold,
in sickness and in health,

17:42.330 --> 17:46.000
for richer or poorer,
to love and to cherish,

17:46.000 --> 17:49.040
till death do you part?

17:49.290 --> 17:50.960
Huh? Uh, yeah, I do.

17:51.170 --> 17:53.330
Rose Oriana, do you take-

17:53.330 --> 17:54.540
I do not.

17:57.170 --> 17:58.170
Huh?

17:58.630 --> 18:00.290
I said, "I do not."

18:02.170 --> 18:03.380
Ridiculous!

18:03.540 --> 18:04.960
How dare you say that?!

18:05.630 --> 18:08.500
I murdered the king, betrayed my kingdom,

18:08.500 --> 18:10.500
and swore allegiance to a
shadowy organization.

18:11.330 --> 18:12.710
I do not excuse myself.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.830
I accept everything.

18:15.330 --> 18:18.460
My guilt, my mistakes, all of it.

18:19.000 --> 18:22.210
But before it's over, I want to make things right.

18:22.670 --> 18:24.420
Duke Perv Asshat...

18:25.330 --> 18:27.000
I pronounce you guilty.

18:27.710 --> 18:28.920
What?

18:28.920 --> 18:32.290
You manipulated my father, the King of Oriana.

18:32.290 --> 18:35.330
You defiled the queen, and you plotted
to overthrow the government.

18:35.330 --> 18:38.080
How dare you?!
Do you have any proof?

18:38.460 --> 18:39.880
No, I do not have proof.

18:41.330 --> 18:43.170
But you know I don't need it.

18:43.380 --> 18:45.830
Do you think this is a game?
I have a hostage!

18:45.830 --> 18:47.040
Don't you get it?!

18:47.250 --> 18:49.460
Be a good girl and marry me.
Then I'll-

18:49.460 --> 18:50.750
I cannot do that.

18:51.790 --> 18:53.580
Y-you little...

18:53.580 --> 18:55.130
Whatever else may happen,

18:55.540 --> 18:57.960
I refuse to give up on true love.

18:58.540 --> 19:02.000
I swear it on this ring that he left to me!

19:03.290 --> 19:04.500
Impossible!

19:11.880 --> 19:13.130
What is...

19:22.880 --> 19:26.330
Is this thing on?
Is it recording?

19:27.170 --> 19:31.040
Father, please forgive your foolish son.

19:31.920 --> 19:35.710
I, Geerk, will now carry out my final act as king.

19:36.580 --> 19:37.790
It can't be...

19:38.500 --> 19:39.500
Geerk!

19:39.500 --> 19:41.960
Attention all citizens of Oriana.

19:41.960 --> 19:46.920
By the time you hear this confession,
I may have already passed on.

19:46.920 --> 19:49.500
I feel my mind whittling away every day,

19:49.500 --> 19:52.170
and soon, I will likely have lost all my senses.

19:52.170 --> 19:55.830
But before that happens,
I want to tell you the truth.

19:55.830 --> 19:59.790
The reason I'm losing my mind is
that I am being drugged.

19:59.790 --> 20:01.580
I don't know how.

20:01.710 --> 20:06.000
I asked my wife Reina to trade out my food,
but it didn't help.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.710
Nothing helped.

20:09.250 --> 20:11.880
But I know who is behind it.

20:12.250 --> 20:14.380
It's Duke Perv Asshat.

20:14.790 --> 20:20.330
The Kingdom of Oriana is under the control of
the enormous organization that backs him.

20:20.580 --> 20:22.250
They're seeing this outside?
Surely many of you thought it strange.<b></b>

20:22.250 --> 20:23.250
Yes.
Surely many of you thought it strange.<b></b>

20:23.250 --> 20:25.170
And most likely, even outside the capital.
He is merely the adopted son of the Asshat line.<b></b>

20:25.170 --> 20:26.750
That's not good.
He is merely the adopted son of the Asshat line.<b></b>

20:26.750 --> 20:29.500
The insurgents might start looking at us next.
How did he get to the center of the Oriana government<b></b>

20:29.500 --> 20:30.500
Then?
How did he get to the center of the Oriana government<b></b>

20:30.500 --> 20:32.830
Get in touch with Grantz and his people.
in such a short period of time?<b></b>

20:32.830 --> 20:34.380
I'll be damned if I'm gonna
I intend to fight, to protect this kingdom,<b></b>

20:34.380 --> 20:36.460
keep sucking up to that nobody.
to protect all of you, to the bitter end.<b></b>

20:38.170 --> 20:41.630
Even if I personally am defeated,
you have nothing to fear.

20:41.670 --> 20:45.580
I leave this kingdom's future in the hands
of the one I trust more than anyone:

20:45.580 --> 20:47.000
my daughter.

20:47.000 --> 20:49.830
Rose Oriana will be your new leader.

20:50.880 --> 20:54.540
No matter what may happen,
I want you to believe in her.

20:54.540 --> 20:59.750
Knowing her, she will most certainly lead
this country down the right path.

21:00.710 --> 21:05.750
Rose, the future of this kingdom is in your hands.

21:08.290 --> 21:11.580
Rose, my daughter...

21:12.830 --> 21:14.380
I love you.

21:22.330 --> 21:24.330
Th... that's nonsense!

21:24.670 --> 21:26.170
You expect us to believe that?!

21:26.170 --> 21:27.380
That ridiculous-

21:27.380 --> 21:29.960
Perv Asshat is a traitor!

21:30.170 --> 21:32.420
Give the crown back to its rightful owner!

21:32.420 --> 21:33.670
Let fall the hammer of justice!

21:33.670 --> 21:34.880
You bastards!
Let fall the hammer of justice!<b></b>

21:35.920 --> 21:39.330
You were happy enough to accept favors from me,
and now you're ready to throw me to-

21:39.330 --> 21:40.790
Duke Perv Asshat!

21:42.880 --> 21:44.960
As the Princess of the Oriana Kingdom...

21:45.460 --> 21:48.250
As she who has been entrusted
with our nation's future...

21:50.580 --> 21:53.920
I, Rose Oriana, pronounce you guilty!

21:54.710 --> 21:55.710
Silence!

21:55.710 --> 21:57.000
Guards! What are you doing?!

21:57.000 --> 21:58.000
Seize this woman!

21:58.000 --> 22:00.040
Hey, isn't it over yet?
Why aren't any of you moving?<b></b>

22:00.040 --> 22:01.710
Your Majesty, we need to get you to-

22:13.920 --> 22:15.130
Perv?

22:25.250 --> 22:26.290
Mother!

22:26.290 --> 22:27.670
Honestly...

22:28.080 --> 22:30.750
I had thought I could get
a little more use out of him.

22:30.750 --> 22:34.080
Incompetent allies are more
trouble than enemies.

22:34.670 --> 22:38.460
Don't you agree, new ruler of Oriana?

22:38.750 --> 22:40.040
Who are you?

22:40.040 --> 22:44.040
Mordred, the Knight Beyond Men,
the Ninth Seat of Rounds.

22:45.420 --> 22:48.630
Accept my heartiest congratulations on
your key succession ceremony.

22:48.630 --> 22:51.500
Now I can finally open the door.

22:52.040 --> 22:53.250
What are you-

22:54.540 --> 22:55.540
What?!

22:55.540 --> 22:59.210
There is no need for the possessor of the key
and the user of the device to be the same person.

22:59.380 --> 23:03.580
All I need is for conditions to be right for
the signal to reach its destination.

23:05.080 --> 23:06.290
Again?!

23:29.710 --> 23:30.920
Is that...

23:30.920 --> 23:32.130
It can't be!

23:32.290 --> 23:34.580
This is the truth behind the legend.

23:34.920 --> 23:39.000
The monster that wiped out 100,000
Velgaltan troops in a single night:

23:39.000 --> 23:40.710
the Black Rose.

23:46.420 --> 23:48.630
"Eliminate all witnesses."

23:48.880 --> 23:51.130
That is the law of the Cult.

23:51.960 --> 23:53.420
Now, come forth!

23:53.420 --> 23:55.670
Grand Ruler of the Fourth Realm!

23:56.750 --> 23:58.130
Ragnarok!

24:15.460 --> 24:18.130
Let the banquet of slaughter begin!

24:19.380 --> 24:20.830
Crush them all!

24:21.380 --> 24:23.580
Archfiend Ragnarok!

24:39.080 --> 24:40.710
A rose that blooms in the sky...

24:41.630 --> 24:43.170
A bat enveloped in flames...

24:43.420 --> 24:45.420
A band of light that razes the earth...

24:45.880 --> 24:48.040
Each of these things is really quite rare.

24:51.130 --> 24:52.330
But...

24:53.040 --> 24:54.460
they are unsightly.

25:09.380 --> 25:13.250
An endlessly deep dark night
Doko made mo fukai yamiyo to<b></b>

25:13.250 --> 25:16.080
I thought, as I closed my eyes
Omotte me o tsubutteta<b></b>

25:16.080 --> 25:21.290
Still unaware of the voice of the star calling out to me
Yobikakeru hoshi no koe ni kizukenai mama<b></b>

25:21.670 --> 25:25.630
A faint light, not too bright
Mabushiku wa nai awai hi<b></b>

25:25.630 --> 25:28.380
But comforting, that's how you were
Kokochi ii sonna anata o<b></b>

25:28.380 --> 25:32.250
Before I knew it, I was following you with my eyes
Shiranu uchi ni me de oikaketa<b></b>

25:32.250 --> 25:34.830
Even if I run out of breath
Iki o kirashite<b></b>

25:35.250 --> 25:38.290
And start to stumble
Motsuresou ni natte mo<b></b>

25:38.290 --> 25:40.540
I've never felt this before
Kono kimochi wa hajimete<b></b>

25:40.540 --> 25:44.460
I can't stop the feeling
Mita koto no nai jibun ni aeru<b></b>

25:44.830 --> 25:48.290
That I can meet a me I've never seen before
Yokan ga tomaranai<b></b>

25:48.790 --> 25:51.710
I run down the path in front of me
Me no mae no michi o hashiru<b></b>

25:51.710 --> 25:54.790
I run far, even when I'm lost
Tooku, mayotte mo<b></b>

25:54.790 --> 25:58.630
If I look up, you won't have changed
Miagereba anata wa kawaranaide<b></b>

25:58.630 --> 26:00.960
You'll be there
Soko ni iru koto o<b></b>

26:00.960 --> 26:03.960
It may be strange, but I can believe it
Fushigi demo shinjirareru<b></b>

26:03.960 --> 26:07.000
Kaze ga tsuyoi hi mo
Even on windy days<b></b>

26:07.000 --> 26:11.500
I don't have to try to reach over you
Over you todokeyou to shinakutatte ii<b></b>

26:11.500 --> 26:13.830
Hey (Did you know?)
Nee (Shitteru?)<b></b>

26:13.830 --> 26:16.880
As all the stars revolve
Subete no hoshi ga mawarinagara<b></b>

26:16.880 --> 26:20.130
I keep my sights on you
Anata o mezashiteru<b></b>

26:20.130 --> 26:23.080
Polaris in the Night
